@startuml ArtanSepet_OrderStates
' Siparis yasam dongusu (State pattern) - v1.0, 19 Kasim 2026
title Siparis Durumlari

[*] --> Reserved : Order.create()\n[stok > 0, teslim kodu uretilir]

Reserved --> Paid : markPaid(transactionId)\n[odeme basarili]
Reserved --> Cancelled : cancel()\n[stok geri birakilir]
Reserved --> Expired : expire()\n[teslim saati gecti]

Paid --> ReadyForPickup : markReady()\n[isletme hazirladi]
Paid --> Cancelled : cancel()\n[stok geri + OrderFacade iade yapar]
Paid --> Expired : expire()\n[stok geri birakilir]

ReadyForPickup --> PickedUp : pickUp(code)\n[kod dogru]
ReadyForPickup --> ReadyForPickup : pickUp(code)\n[kod yanlis -> InvalidPickupCodeException]
ReadyForPickup --> Expired : expire()\n[teslim alinmadi, stok geri]

PickedUp --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
Expired --> [*]

note right of ReadyForPickup
  Iptal edilemez: isletme
  paketi hazirlamistir.
end note

note right of PickedUp
  Son durumlar (PickedUp, Cancelled, Expired):
  her islem InvalidStateTransitionException
end note

note bottom of Expired
  ExpirationService.expireOverdueOrders(now)
  teslim saati gecen acik siparisleri buraya tasir.
end note
@enduml
